    {
      "id": "coriolanus/sceneV_6.4/p@213312",
      "type": "stage",
      "tag": "p",
      "classes": [
        "scenedesc"
      ],
      "text": "Enter Menenius and Sicinius.",
      "separatorAfter": "\n\n",
      "spans": [
        {
          "tag": "span",
          "start": 6,
          "end": 14,
          "className": "charname"
        },
        {
          "tag": "span",
          "start": 19,
          "end": 27,
          "className": "charname"
        }
      ],
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "coriolanus/sceneV_6.4/p@213312/line-1",
          "start": 0,
          "end": 28,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        }
      ],
      "sourceRef": {
        "start": 1033024,
        "end": 1033142,
        "line": 39284,
        "column": 1,
        "path": "chap06/p@213312",
        "anchor": "sceneV_6.4"
      },
      "speakerLabel": null,
      "attribution": {
        "status": "not-applicable"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coriolanus/sceneV_6.4/p@213434",
      "type": "speech",
      "tag": "p",
      "classes": [
        "drama"
      ],
      "text": "MENENIUS.\nSee you yond coign o’ the Capitol, yond cornerstone?",
      "separatorAfter": "\n\n",
      "spans": [],
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "coriolanus/sceneV_6.4/p@213434/line-1",
          "start": 0,
          "end": 9,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "coriolanus/sceneV_6.4/p@213434/line-2",
          "start": 10,
          "end": 62,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        }
      ],
      "sourceRef": {
        "start": 1033146,
        "end": 1033238,
        "line": 39289,
        "column": 1,
        "path": "chap06/p@213434",
        "anchor": "sceneV_6.4"
      },
      "speakerLabel": "MENENIUS.",
      "attribution": {
        "status": "explicit",
        "cueStart": 0,
        "cueEnd": 9
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coriolanus/sceneV_6.4/p@213530",
      "type": "speech",
      "tag": "p",
      "classes": [
        "drama"
      ],
      "text": "SICINIUS.\nWhy, what of that?",
      "separatorAfter": "\n\n",
      "spans": [],
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "coriolanus/sceneV_6.4/p@213530/line-1",
          "start": 0,
          "end": 9,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "coriolanus/sceneV_6.4/p@213530/line-2",
          "start": 10,
          "end": 28,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        }
      ],
      "sourceRef": {
        "start": 1033242,
        "end": 1033300,
        "line": 39294,
        "column": 1,
        "path": "chap06/p@213530",
        "anchor": "sceneV_6.4"
      },
      "speakerLabel": "SICINIUS.",
      "attribution": {
        "status": "explicit",
        "cueStart": 0,
        "cueEnd": 9
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coriolanus/sceneV_6.4/p@213592",
      "type": "speech",
      "tag": "p",
      "classes": [
        "drama"
      ],
      "text": "MENENIUS.\nIf it be possible for you to displace it with your little finger, there is some hope the ladies of Rome, especially his mother, may prevail with him. But I say there is no hope in’t. Our throats are sentenced and stay upon execution.",
      "separatorAfter": "\n\n",
      "spans": [],
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "coriolanus/sceneV_6.4/p@213592/line-1",
          "start": 0,
          "end": 9,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "coriolanus/sceneV_6.4/p@213592/line-2",
          "start": 10,
          "end": 243,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        }
      ],
      "sourceRef": {
        "start": 1033304,
        "end": 1033579,
        "line": 39299,
        "column": 1,
        "path": "chap06/p@213592",
        "anchor": "sceneV_6.4"
      },
      "speakerLabel": "MENENIUS.",
      "attribution": {
        "status": "explicit",
        "cueStart": 0,
        "cueEnd": 9
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coriolanus/sceneV_6.4/p@213871",
      "type": "speech",
      "tag": "p",
      "classes": [
        "drama"
      ],
      "text": "SICINIUS.\nIs’t possible that so short a time can alter the condition of a man?",
      "separatorAfter": "\n\n",
      "spans": [],
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "coriolanus/sceneV_6.4/p@213871/line-1",
          "start": 0,
          "end": 9,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "coriolanus/sceneV_6.4/p@213871/line-2",
          "start": 10,
          "end": 78,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        }
      ],
      "sourceRef": {
        "start": 1033583,
        "end": 1033691,
        "line": 39306,
        "column": 1,
        "path": "chap06/p@213871",
        "anchor": "sceneV_6.4"
      },
      "speakerLabel": "SICINIUS.",
      "attribution": {
        "status": "explicit",
        "cueStart": 0,
        "cueEnd": 9
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coriolanus/sceneV_6.4/p@213983",
      "type": "speech",
      "tag": "p",
      "classes": [
        "drama"
      ],
      "text": "MENENIUS.\nThere is differency between a grub and a butterfly, yet your butterfly was a grub. This Martius is grown from man to dragon. He has wings; he’s more than a creeping thing.",
      "separatorAfter": "\n\n",
      "spans": [],
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "coriolanus/sceneV_6.4/p@213983/line-1",
          "start": 0,
          "end": 9,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "coriolanus/sceneV_6.4/p@213983/line-2",
          "start": 10,
          "end": 181,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        }
      ],
      "sourceRef": {
        "start": 1033695,
        "end": 1033908,
        "line": 39311,
        "column": 1,
        "path": "chap06/p@213983",
        "anchor": "sceneV_6.4"
      },
      "speakerLabel": "MENENIUS.",
      "attribution": {
        "status": "explicit",
        "cueStart": 0,
        "cueEnd": 9
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coriolanus/sceneV_6.4/p@214200",
      "type": "speech",
      "tag": "p",
      "classes": [
        "drama"
      ],
      "text": "SICINIUS.\nHe loved his mother dearly.",
      "separatorAfter": "\n\n",
      "spans": [],
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "coriolanus/sceneV_6.4/p@214200/line-1",
          "start": 0,
          "end": 9,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "coriolanus/sceneV_6.4/p@214200/line-2",
          "start": 10,
          "end": 37,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        }
      ],
      "sourceRef": {
        "start": 1033912,
        "end": 1033979,
        "line": 39318,
        "column": 1,
        "path": "chap06/p@214200",
        "anchor": "sceneV_6.4"
      },
      "speakerLabel": "SICINIUS.",
      "attribution": {
        "status": "explicit",
        "cueStart": 0,
        "cueEnd": 9
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coriolanus/sceneV_6.4/p@214271",
      "type": "speech",
      "tag": "p",
      "classes": [
        "drama"
      ],
      "text": "MENENIUS.\nSo did he me; and he no more remembers his mother now than an eight-year-old horse. The tartness of his face sours ripe grapes. When he walks, he moves like an engine, and the ground shrinks before his treading. He is able to pierce a corslet with his eye, talks like a knell, and his hum is a battery. He sits in his state as a thing made for Alexander. What he bids be done is finished with his bidding. He wants nothing of a god but eternity and a heaven to throne in.",
      "separatorAfter": "\n\n",
      "spans": [],
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "coriolanus/sceneV_6.4/p@214271/line-1",
          "start": 0,
          "end": 9,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "coriolanus/sceneV_6.4/p@214271/line-2",
          "start": 10,
          "end": 481,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        }
      ],
      "sourceRef": {
        "start": 1033983,
        "end": 1034499,
        "line": 39323,
        "column": 1,
        "path": "chap06/p@214271",
        "anchor": "sceneV_6.4"
      },
      "speakerLabel": "MENENIUS.",
      "attribution": {
        "status": "explicit",
        "cueStart": 0,
        "cueEnd": 9
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coriolanus/sceneV_6.4/p@214791",
      "type": "speech",
      "tag": "p",
      "classes": [
        "drama"
      ],
      "text": "SICINIUS.\nYes, mercy, if you report him truly.",
      "separatorAfter": "\n\n",
      "spans": [],
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "coriolanus/sceneV_6.4/p@214791/line-1",
          "start": 0,
          "end": 9,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "coriolanus/sceneV_6.4/p@214791/line-2",
          "start": 10,
          "end": 46,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        }
      ],
      "sourceRef": {
        "start": 1034503,
        "end": 1034579,
        "line": 39333,
        "column": 1,
        "path": "chap06/p@214791",
        "anchor": "sceneV_6.4"
      },
      "speakerLabel": "SICINIUS.",
      "attribution": {
        "status": "explicit",
        "cueStart": 0,
        "cueEnd": 9
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coriolanus/sceneV_6.4/p@214871",
      "type": "speech",
      "tag": "p",
      "classes": [
        "drama"
      ],
      "text": "MENENIUS.\nI paint him in the character. Mark what mercy his mother shall bring from him. There is no more mercy in him than there is milk in a male tiger. That shall our poor city find, and all this is long of you.",
      "separatorAfter": "\n\n",
      "spans": [],
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "coriolanus/sceneV_6.4/p@214871/line-1",
          "start": 0,
          "end": 9,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "coriolanus/sceneV_6.4/p@214871/line-2",
          "start": 10,
          "end": 214,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        }
      ],
      "sourceRef": {
        "start": 1034583,
        "end": 1034829,
        "line": 39338,
        "column": 1,
        "path": "chap06/p@214871",
        "anchor": "sceneV_6.4"
      },
      "speakerLabel": "MENENIUS.",
      "attribution": {
        "status": "explicit",
        "cueStart": 0,
        "cueEnd": 9
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coriolanus/sceneV_6.4/p@215121",
      "type": "speech",
      "tag": "p",
      "classes": [
        "drama"
      ],
      "text": "SICINIUS.\nThe gods be good unto us.",
      "separatorAfter": "\n\n",
      "spans": [],
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "coriolanus/sceneV_6.4/p@215121/line-1",
          "start": 0,
          "end": 9,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "coriolanus/sceneV_6.4/p@215121/line-2",
          "start": 10,
          "end": 35,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        }
      ],
      "sourceRef": {
        "start": 1034833,
        "end": 1034898,
        "line": 39345,
        "column": 1,
        "path": "chap06/p@215121",
        "anchor": "sceneV_6.4"
      },
      "speakerLabel": "SICINIUS.",
      "attribution": {
        "status": "explicit",
        "cueStart": 0,
        "cueEnd": 9
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coriolanus/sceneV_6.4/p@215190",
      "type": "speech",
      "tag": "p",
      "classes": [
        "drama"
      ],
      "text": "MENENIUS.\nNo, in such a case the gods will not be good unto us. When we banished him, we respected not them; and he returning to break our necks, they respect not us.",
      "separatorAfter": "\n\n",
      "spans": [],
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "coriolanus/sceneV_6.4/p@215190/line-1",
          "start": 0,
          "end": 9,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "coriolanus/sceneV_6.4/p@215190/line-2",
          "start": 10,
          "end": 166,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        }
      ],
      "sourceRef": {
        "start": 1034902,
        "end": 1035099,
        "line": 39350,
        "column": 1,
        "path": "chap06/p@215190",
        "anchor": "sceneV_6.4"
      },
      "speakerLabel": "MENENIUS.",
      "attribution": {
        "status": "explicit",
        "cueStart": 0,
        "cueEnd": 9
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coriolanus/sceneV_6.4/p@215391",
      "type": "stage",
      "tag": "p",
      "classes": [
        "scenedesc"
      ],
      "text": "Enter a Messenger.",
      "separatorAfter": "\n\n",
      "spans": [
        {
          "tag": "span",
          "start": 8,
          "end": 17,
          "className": "charname"
        }
      ],
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "coriolanus/sceneV_6.4/p@215391/line-1",
          "start": 0,
          "end": 18,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        }
      ],
      "sourceRef": {
        "start": 1035103,
        "end": 1035180,
        "line": 39356,
        "column": 1,
        "path": "chap06/p@215391",
        "anchor": "sceneV_6.4"
      },
      "speakerLabel": null,
      "attribution": {
        "status": "not-applicable"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coriolanus/sceneV_6.4/p@215472",
      "type": "speech",
      "tag": "p",
      "classes": [
        "drama"
      ],
      "text": "MESSENGER.\nSir, if you’d save your life, fly to your house.\nThe plebeians have got your fellow tribune\nAnd hale him up and down, all swearing if\nThe Roman ladies bring not comfort home,\nThey’ll give him death by inches.",
      "separatorAfter": "\n\n",
      "spans": [],
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "coriolanus/sceneV_6.4/p@215472/line-1",
          "start": 0,
          "end": 10,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "coriolanus/sceneV_6.4/p@215472/line-2",
          "start": 11,
          "end": 59,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "coriolanus/sceneV_6.4/p@215472/line-3",
          "start": 60,
          "end": 102,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "coriolanus/sceneV_6.4/p@215472/line-4",
          "start": 103,
          "end": 144,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "coriolanus/sceneV_6.4/p@215472/line-5",
          "start": 145,
          "end": 185,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "coriolanus/sceneV_6.4/p@215472/line-6",
          "start": 186,
          "end": 219,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        }
      ],
      "sourceRef": {
        "start": 1035184,
        "end": 1035453,
        "line": 39360,
        "column": 1,
        "path": "chap06/p@215472",
        "anchor": "sceneV_6.4"
      },
      "speakerLabel": "MESSENGER.",
      "attribution": {
        "status": "explicit",
        "cueStart": 0,
        "cueEnd": 10
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coriolanus/sceneV_6.4/p@215745",
      "type": "stage",
      "tag": "p",
      "classes": [
        "scenedesc"
      ],
      "text": "Enter another Messenger.",
      "separatorAfter": "\n\n",
      "spans": [
        {
          "tag": "span",
          "start": 14,
          "end": 23,
          "className": "charname"
        }
      ],
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "coriolanus/sceneV_6.4/p@215745/line-1",
          "start": 0,
          "end": 24,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        }
      ],
      "sourceRef": {
        "start": 1035457,
        "end": 1035540,
        "line": 39369,
        "column": 1,
        "path": "chap06/p@215745",
        "anchor": "sceneV_6.4"
      },
      "speakerLabel": null,
      "attribution": {
        "status": "not-applicable"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coriolanus/sceneV_6.4/p@215832",
      "type": "speech",
      "tag": "p",
      "classes": [
        "drama"
      ],
      "text": "SICINIUS.\nWhat’s the news?",
      "separatorAfter": "\n\n",
      "spans": [],
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "coriolanus/sceneV_6.4/p@215832/line-1",
          "start": 0,
          "end": 9,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "coriolanus/sceneV_6.4/p@215832/line-2",
          "start": 10,
          "end": 26,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        }
      ],
      "sourceRef": {
        "start": 1035544,
        "end": 1035600,
        "line": 39373,
        "column": 1,
        "path": "chap06/p@215832",
        "anchor": "sceneV_6.4"
      },
      "speakerLabel": "SICINIUS.",
      "attribution": {
        "status": "explicit",
        "cueStart": 0,
        "cueEnd": 9
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coriolanus/sceneV_6.4/p@215892",
      "type": "speech",
      "tag": "p",
      "classes": [
        "drama"
      ],
      "text": "SECOND MESSENGER.\nGood news, good news! The ladies have prevailed.\nThe Volscians are dislodged and Martius gone.\nA merrier day did never yet greet Rome,\nNo, not th’ expulsion of the Tarquins.",
      "separatorAfter": "\n\n",
      "spans": [],
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "coriolanus/sceneV_6.4/p@215892/line-1",
          "start": 0,
          "end": 17,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "coriolanus/sceneV_6.4/p@215892/line-2",
          "start": 18,
          "end": 66,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "coriolanus/sceneV_6.4/p@215892/line-3",
          "start": 67,
          "end": 112,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "coriolanus/sceneV_6.4/p@215892/line-4",
          "start": 113,
          "end": 152,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "coriolanus/sceneV_6.4/p@215892/line-5",
          "start": 153,
          "end": 191,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        }
      ],
      "sourceRef": {
        "start": 1035604,
        "end": 1035840,
        "line": 39378,
        "column": 1,
        "path": "chap06/p@215892",
        "anchor": "sceneV_6.4"
      },
      "speakerLabel": "SECOND MESSENGER.",
      "attribution": {
        "status": "explicit",
        "cueStart": 0,
        "cueEnd": 17
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coriolanus/sceneV_6.4/p@216132",
      "type": "speech",
      "tag": "p",
      "classes": [
        "drama"
      ],
      "text": "SICINIUS.\nFriend,\nArt thou certain this is true? Is’t most certain?",
      "separatorAfter": "\n\n",
      "spans": [],
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "coriolanus/sceneV_6.4/p@216132/line-1",
          "start": 0,
          "end": 9,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "coriolanus/sceneV_6.4/p@216132/line-2",
          "start": 10,
          "end": 17,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "coriolanus/sceneV_6.4/p@216132/line-3",
          "start": 18,
          "end": 67,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        }
      ],
      "sourceRef": {
        "start": 1035844,
        "end": 1035946,
        "line": 39386,
        "column": 1,
        "path": "chap06/p@216132",
